OL,3,GNEWSAGetting river pollution
OL,4,Ainvestigated like 'pulling teeth'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn oil-like substance has been bubbling
OL,7,Fup in the River Avon in Bristol for
OL,8,Fyears and killing wildlife, according
OL,9,Fto local residents who have made
OL,10,Fregular reports to the Environment
OL,11,FAgency (EA).
OL,13,FNicola Irvine, who lives in Crews Hole,
OL,14,Fsaid it had been like "pulling teeth"
OL,15,Fgetting the EA to investigate the
OL,16,Fpollution since she contacted them in
OL,17,FJuly 2025.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
