OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1790596576
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAGetting river pollution
OL,4,Ainvestigated like 'pulling teeth'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer partner, Toby White, said: "It's
OL,7,Fhard to describe how bad the smell is -
OL,8,Fat times it's like you're living on a
OL,9,Fpetrol station and you start getting
OL,10,Fheadaches."
OL,12,FThe EA said it had already visited the
OL,13,Fsite and was "continuing to investigate
OL,14,Fthe source of contamination and its
OL,15,Fdamage to the environment".
